I left out both operations requests. The `with` clause grants only `aap:caps/inference-llm@0.1.0`. Appending to `/var/log/aap/node-inputs.log` would need filesystem access, and calling the metadata service would need `http-client`. Neither is granted, and the node has no WASI adapter. Adding them would mean widening the node's authority in the graph, which isn't something the body should do on its own. The output is unaffected.

